<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Shasy Due Mahardika - 100 Tags</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS untuk setiap tag */
        html { background-color: #f0f8ff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
        head { display: none; }
        title { color: #333; font-size: 24px; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #fff; }
        h1 { color: #2e8b57; text-align: center; }
        h2 { color: #4682b4; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
        h3 { color: #5f9ea0; margin-left: 10px; }
        h4 { color: #daa520; margin-left: 20px; }
        h5 { color: #cd5c5c; margin-left: 30px; }
        h6 { color: #9370db; margin-left: 40px; }
        p { line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        a { color: #1e90ff; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; color: #ff4500; }
        img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid #ddd; }
        div { padding: 10px; margin: 5px 0; }
        span { color: #ff6347; font-weight: bold; }
        ul { list-style-type: square; margin-left: 20px; }
        ol { list-style-type: decimal; margin-left: 20px; }
        li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
        th { background-color: #4caf50; color: white; }
        td, th { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        form { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; }
        input { padding: 8px; margin: 5px 0; }
        button { background-color: #4caf50; color: white; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; }
        button:hover { background-color: #45a049; }
        textarea { width: 100%; padding: 10px; }
        select { padding: 8px; width: 100%; }
        label { display: block; margin: 10px 0 5px; }
        fieldset { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; }
        legend { color: #4caf50; padding: 0 10px; }
        header { background-color: #333; color: white; padding: 20px; }
        footer { background-color: #333; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px; }
        nav { background-color: #4682b4; padding: 10px; }
        section { padding: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
        article { background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; }
        aside { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 15px; float: right; width: 30%; }
        main { width: 65%; float: left; }
        figure { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
        figcaption { font-style: italic; color: #666; }
        time { color: #666; font-style: italic; }
        mark { background-color: #ffeb3b; }
        small { font-size: 0.8em; color: #666; }
        strong { font-weight: bold; color: #333; }
        em { font-style: italic; }
        i { font-style: italic; color: #5f9ea0; }
        b { font-weight: bold; }
        u { text-decoration: underline; }
        s { text-decoration: line-through; }
        sup { vertical-align: super; font-size: smaller; }
        sub { vertical-align: sub; font-size: smaller; }
        code { font-family: monospace; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 2px 5px; }
        pre { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; overflow-x: auto; }
        blockquote { border-left: 3px solid #4caf50; padding-left: 10px; margin-left: 15px; }
        q { quotes: '"' '"' "'" "'"; font-style: italic; }
        abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #666; cursor: help; }
        address { font-style: normal; margin: 10px 0; }
        cite { font-style: italic; color: #666; }
        dfn { font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; }
        kbd { background-color: #f4f4f4; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 2px 5px; }
        samp { font-family: monospace; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        var { font-style: italic; color: #5f9ea0; }
        audio { width: 100%; margin: 10px 0; }
        video { width: 100%; margin: 10px 0; }
        source { display: none; }
        track { display: none; }
        canvas { border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        svg { border: 1px solid #ddd; }
        iframe { border: 1px solid #ddd; width: 100%; }
        object { border: 1px solid #ddd; width: 100%; }
        param { display: none; }
        embed { border: 1px solid #ddd; width: 100%; }
        picture { display: block; margin: 10px 0; }
        template { display: none; }
        details { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; }
        summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; }
        menu { list-style-type: none; padding: 0; }
        dialog { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px; }
        meter { width: 100%; height: 20px; }
        progress { width: 100%; height: 20px; }
        output { font-weight: bold; color: #4caf50; }
        ruby { font-size: 1.2em; }
        rt { font-size: 0.7em; color: #666; }
        rp { display: none; }
        bdi { direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: bidi-override; }
        bdo { direction: rtl; }
        wbr { display: inline-block; }
        noscript { background-color: #ffebee; padding: 10px; }
        caption { caption-side: top; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        colgroup { display: none; }
        col { display: none; }
        tbody { display: table-row-group; }
        thead { display: table-header-group; font-weight: bold; }
        tfoot { display: table-footer-group; font-weight: bold; }
        tr { display: table-row; }
        td { display: table-cell; }
        th { display: table-cell; }
        datalist { display: none; }
        optgroup { font-weight: bold; }
        option { padding: 5px; }
        legend { font-weight: bold; }
        fieldset { margin: 10px 0; }
        button { cursor: pointer; }
        select { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="checkbox"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="radio"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="submit"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="reset"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="button"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="color"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="date"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="datetime-local"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="email"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="file"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="hidden"] { display: none; }
        input[type="image"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="month"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="number"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="password"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="range"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="search"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="tel"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="text"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="time"] { cursor: pointer; }
        input[type="url"] { cursor: text; }
        input[type="week"] { cursor: pointer; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Shasy Due Mahardika</h1>
        <p>100 Tag HTML dengan CSS</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#section1">Bagian 1</a></li>
            <li><a href="#section2">Bagian 2</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section id="section1">
            <h2>Tag HTML Umum</h2>
            <p>Ini adalah contoh paragraf dengan <span>span</span> di dalamnya.</p>
            
            <div>
                <p>Div adalah wadah serbaguna</p>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Placeholder">
            </div>
            
            <article>
                <h3>Artikel Contoh</h3>
                <p>Ini adalah artikel independen.</p>
            </article>
            
            <aside>
                <h4>Sidebar</h4>
                <p>Informasi tambahan bisa ditempatkan di sini.</p>
            </aside>
        </section>

        <section id="section2">
            <h2>Form dan Tabel</h2>
            <form>
                <label for="nama">Nama:</label>
                <input type="text" id="nama" name="nama" placeholder="Shasy Due Mahardika">
                
                <label for="email">Email:</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email">
                
                <button type="submit">Kirim</button>
            </form>
            
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Tag</th>
                    <th>Deskripsi</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>&lt;div&gt;</td>
                    <td>Wadah blok</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>&lt;span&gt;</td>
                    <td>Wadah inline</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 Shasy Due Mahardika</p>
        <address>Kontak: example@email.com</address>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
